text: >-
  IN THE FOURTH DISTRICT COURT - ALL DEPARTMENT

  IN AND FOR UTAH COUNTY, STATE OF UTAH

  AFFIDAVIT FOR SEARCH WARRANT

  STATE OF UTAH)

  iSS

  County of Utah)

  1, JUSTIN BOWEN, a Investigator with the State Bureau of Investigation,
  currently assigned to

  the Major Crimes Unit, being duly sworn, state as follows:

  This affidavit is submitted in support of a search warrant application for a
  search of the Quantum

  Fiber (Owned by Lumen Technologies) accounts) identified by this user:

  Username: trobinsonut@gmail.com

  at

  Lumen Technologies,

  5325 ZUNI STREET ROOM 750 Denver, CO 80221.

  This affidavit is submitted Under Utah code Title 77 Chapters 23b, 23c, or 23f
  in support of a

  search warrant application for a search and seizure of location information,
  stored or transmitted

  data, electronic information transmitted by the owner to a remote computer
  service or through an

  electronic communication service, the contents of an electronic communication
  in electronic

  storage of an electronic communication service, or identifying information for
  an electronic

  device, of any kind (including those that are currently stored or were
  stored), as specifically

  identified in this warrant for the Quantum Fiber (Owned by Lumen Technologies)
  accounts)

  associated with Username: trobinsonut@gmail.com, which constitute evidence of
  a crime,

  contraband, fruits of a crime, or other items illegally possessed, or property
  designed for use,

  intended for use, or use in committing a crime, to wit: Aggravated Murder, in
  violation of Utah

  law section 76-5-202 et seq

  Since this affidavit is being submitted for the limited purpose of securing a
  Search Warrant, I

  have not included each and every fact known to me concerning this
  investigation. I have set forth

  only the facts that I believe are necessary to establish probable cause to
  believe that evidence of

  violations of state and/or federal laws involving Aggravated Murder will be
  located in the

  Quantum Fiber (Owned by Lumen Technologies) accounts) belonging to:

  Username: trobinsonut@gmail.com

  The information contained within this affidavit is based on my knowledge,
  training, experience,

  and/or information related to me by other law enforcement officers.
